    "traits": "Invested, Warding",
    "description": "<p><strong>INVESTED WARDING</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 8; <strong>Price</strong> 5,000 gp; <strong>Usage</strong> worn; <strong>Weight</strong> 10 lbs</p>\n<p><em>An ornate incense burner with a fragrant blend of rare herbs and resins. When the incense is lit, it releases a calming aroma.</em></p>\n<p>When the Mystic Incense Burner is lit and placed in a room, it creates an aura of tranquillity. All creatures within a 30-foot radius gain a +1-resistance bonus to Will saves against fear and charm effects while they remain in the area. Furthermore, all creatures in the area of effect also gain a +2-status bonus to Meditation skill checks. The incense will burn for 1 hour after which it must be replenished.</p>\n<p>Incense for the burner is a common level 0 item which can be purchased for 5 gp per use</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> its Use burns one Incense from your gear and lights it for 1 hour (B9-7): every creature within 30 feet of you, you included, gains +1 resistance to Will saves against fear and charm (automatic where the save's traits say so, offered otherwise) and +2 status to Meditation, offered on the check (interpretation 3). Use it again while it burns to put it out.</p>",
